  "description": "As a broke college student, Kay needs to find a place to settle down in the cheapest way possible. Her solution? Having a roommate! Little did she know, that her previous high school friend Cam is also experiencing the same housing issue. Even though they’re polar opposites of each other, they agree to become roommates. Will they be able to live comfortably together? Their day-to-day life shenanigans start... now!\n\n(Source: Webtoon)",
